#* {{quote-song|en|artist=w:Sean Combs|feat=w:Mase|title=w:Can't Nobody Hold Me Down|url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6rWhStXYND0|date=3 January 1997|passage=Did fed time outta town '''pie''' flipper / Turn Cristal into a crooked-I sipper}}
